WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:09.720
One page for the owners each month: the figures, highlights and risks, sent by email on the day you choose.

2
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:17.080
The owner report sums up a month for the owners: billing, collections, occupancy, sales, visitors and parking.

3
00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:22.280
It opens on the last full month. Choose another month here.

4
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:26.140
Each figure is compared with the month before.

5
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:33.170
Highlights and risks are written for you from the numbers. The same sentences open the report.

6
00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:38.390
Under Monthly email, enter who receives it.

7
00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:44.980
Choose the language, or both, and the day of the month it goes out.

8
00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:50.090
Save. From now on it is sent by itself.

9
00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:54.120
Send now sends this month's report straight away.

10
00:00:54.120 --> 00:01:00.190
And this is the report itself, ready to print or save as a document.

11
00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:05.510
Print it, or save it as a document to attach.
